{"asset_key":"ep1/quest_story_11203220","episode":"ep1","category":"quest_story","story_id":"11203220","schema_version":1,"lang":"cn","texts":{"say:3:1120322001:1":{"text":"这个……那个……就是那个嘛……那个，各位都知道的……你们答应过我的……","source_cn":"这个……那个……就是那个嘛……那个，各位都知道的……你...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x404096673C8CDB89","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1120322002:1":{"text":"对不起，我只顾着高兴，忘记了。请说，你需要什么报酬？","source_cn":"对不起，我只顾着高兴，忘记了。请说，你需要什么报酬？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x02313244CEDAD740","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1120322003:1":{"text":"你放心，承诺给你的报酬，我们不会食言。","source_cn":"你放心，承诺给你的报酬，我们不会食言。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDDB29F0E5AF21D04","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1120322004:1":{"text":"哎呀，这个说来有点不好意思……","source_cn":"哎呀，这个说来有点不好意思……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1B1DE3C5D494BE7A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1120322005:1":{"text":"这只狐獴怎么忽然笑得这么羞涩，让我有种不祥的预感……","source_cn":"这只狐獴怎么忽然笑得这么羞涩，让我有种不祥的预感……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF823DD8839CDFCEB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1120322006:1":{"text":"嘿嘿，各位放心，我的要求非常朴实无华，各位一定轻松就能满足的——","source_cn":"嘿嘿，各位放心，我的要求非常朴实无华，各位一定轻松就能...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x96148C4E013727A6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1120322007:1":{"text":"我就是想要给部落里的孩子们带点食物回去，仅此而已。","source_cn":"我就是想要给部落里的孩子们带点食物回去，仅此而已。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBC9A0761CCBF1F15","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1120322008:1":{"text":"原来只是食物啊，没问题，包在我们身上了！","source_cn":"原来只是食物啊，没问题，包在我们身上了！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC82817CDA613C72E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:13:1120322008":{"text":"原来只是食物啊，没问题，包在我们身上了！","source_cn":"原来只是食物啊，没问题，包在我们身上了！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC82817CDA613C72E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1120322009:1":{"text":"还是这位魔法师大人问得好！我想要的就是对我们狐獴来说，最最最美味的——","source_cn":"还是这位魔法师大人问得好！我想要的就是对我们狐獴来说，...","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xAC371D5300E7DDE9","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"还是这位魔法师大人问得好！我想要的就是对我们狐獴来说，最最最美味的——","female":"还是这位魔法师大人问得好！我想要的就是对我们狐獴来说，最最最美味的——","variant_male_record_index":"124725","variant_female_record_index":"124726","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_